{
  "name": "Shocker (OpenShock + PiShock)",
  "id": "shocker",
  "version": "2.2.2",
  "author": "ArcticTechy",
  "image": "logo.png",
  "description": "Control OpenShock and PiShock from OSC-DreamChatbox. Live who on OpenShock. Optional event that temporarily replaces the whole chatbox when a shock happens. Duration shown as 0.3 s. Idle last-action timeout.",
  "about": {
    "format": "markdown",
    "text": [
      "## Shocker plugin",
      "",
      "OpenShock + PiShock in one plugin. Placeholders use the **shocker** prefix.",
      "",
      "### Placeholders",
      "- `{shocker}` – status line (or event line while an event is active)",
      "- `{shocker_status}` – Connected / Offline / Error",
      "- `{shocker_last}` – last command (includes by Name when live)",
      "- `{shocker_intensity}` – last intensity",
      "- `{shocker_duration}` – last duration text",
      "- `{shocker_type}` – Shock / Vibrate / Sound / …",
      "- `{shocker_device}` – selected shocker name",
      "- `{shocker_by}` – who triggered it (OpenShock live)",
      "- `{shocker_event}` – event line only while an event is showing, else empty",
      "",
      "### Live event (replace chatbox)",
      "Enable **Replace chatbox on action**. When you (or someone else on OpenShock) trigger a command, the plugin temporarily replaces the **entire** chatbox text with your **Event template** for a few seconds, then returns to normal.",
      "",
      "Event template may use the same placeholders, e.g.",
      "`⚡ {shocker_type} {shocker_intensity}% by {shocker_by}`",
      "",
      "### Idle last-message timeout",
      "Under **Chatbox line (idle)** set **Last action stays for** (seconds).",
      "0 = forever. When the timer ends the last shock disappears from the normal status line.",
      "Independent of the replace-chatbox event."
    ]
  },
  "short_description": "OpenShock + PiShock control, live who, chatbox event flash",
  "tags": [
    "openshock",
    "pishock",
    "shock",
    "estim",
    "control",
    "hardware"
  ],
  "Github": "https://github.com/ArcticTechy/OSC-DreamChatbox-OpenShock",
  "main": "main.py",
  "enabled": false,
  "api": 2,
  "min_app": "v1.3.2",
  "is_linux": true,
  "is_windows": true,
  "template": "{shocker}",
  "layout": [
    "settings",
    "chatbox"
  ],
  "chatbox": {
    "enabled": true,
    "user_editable": true
  },
  "placeholders": {
    "status": "connection state",
    "last": "last control command",
    "intensity": "last intensity",
    "duration": "last duration text",
    "type": "Shock / Vibrate / Sound / Stop / Beep",
    "device": "selected shocker name",
    "by": "who triggered the last action",
    "event": "event line while a live event is showing"
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "type": "label",
      "label": "Shocker",
      "default": "Pick a backend. Network never blocks the UI."
    },
    {
      "key": "backend",
      "type": "choice",
      "label": "Backend",
      "default": "openshock",
      "choices": [
        {
          "value": "openshock",
          "label": "OpenShock (openshock.app)"
        },
        {
          "value": "pishock",
          "label": "PiShock (pishock.com)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "g_openshock",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "OpenShock",
      "items": [
        {
          "key": "os_token",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "API Token",
          "default": "",
          "secret": true,
          "hint": "Open-Shock-Token from openshock.app → Settings → API Tokens"
        },
        {
          "key": "os_base_url",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "API Base URL",
          "default": "https://api.openshock.app",
          "hint": "Self-host only. No trailing slash."
        },
        {
          "key": "os_user_agent",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "User-Agent",
          "default": "OSC-DreamChatbox-Shocker/2.1"
        },
        {
          "key": "os_shocker_id",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Shocker ID (UUID)",
          "default": ""
        },
        {
          "key": "os_watch_logs",
          "type": "bool",
          "label": "Watch live logs (show who)",
          "default": true,
          "hint": "Poll logs so website / other apps show up with the username."
        },
        {
          "key": "os_poll_secs",
          "type": "int",
          "label": "Log poll interval",
          "default": 5,
          "min": 1,
          "max": 60,
          "suffix": " s"
        }
      ],
      "expanded": true
    },
    {
      "key": "g_pishock",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "PiShock",
      "items": [
        {
          "key": "ps_username",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Username",
          "default": ""
        },
        {
          "key": "ps_apikey",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "API Key",
          "default": "",
          "secret": true
        },
        {
          "key": "ps_sharecode",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Share Code",
          "default": ""
        },
        {
          "key": "ps_log_name",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Log name",
          "default": "OSC-DreamChatbox"
        }
      ],
      "expanded": false
    },
    {
      "key": "g_event",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Live event (replace chatbox)",
      "items": [
        {
          "key": "event_enabled",
          "type": "bool",
          "label": "Replace chatbox on action",
          "default": true,
          "hint": "Temporarily replace the whole VRChat chatbox text when a command is sent or seen live."
        },
        {
          "key": "event_template",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Event template",
          "default": "⚡ '{shocker_device}' {shocker_intensity}%:{shocker_duration} by {shocker_by}",
          "hint": "Shown instead of the normal chatbox for a few seconds. Placeholders work."
        },
        {
          "key": "event_seconds",
          "type": "int",
          "label": "Show for",
          "default": 4,
          "min": 1,
          "max": 30,
          "suffix": " s"
        }
      ],
      "expanded": true
    },
    {
      "key": "g_common",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Defaults & status",
      "items": [
        {
          "key": "status_label",
          "type": "label",
          "label": "Status",
          "default": "not configured"
        },
        {
          "key": "btn_refresh",
          "type": "action",
          "label": "Refresh",
          "button": "Refresh",
          "style": "accent"
        },
        {
          "key": "intensity",
          "type": "slider",
          "label": "Intensity",
          "default": 30,
          "min": 1,
          "max": 100,
          "suffix": " %"
        },
        {
          "key": "max_intensity",
          "type": "int",
          "label": "Max intensity",
          "default": 100,
          "min": 1,
          "max": 100,
          "suffix": " %",
          "hint": "Hard cap. Buttons and live commands will never go above this."
        },
        {
          "key": "duration_ms",
          "type": "int",
          "label": "Duration (OpenShock)",
          "default": 1000,
          "min": 300,
          "max": 30000,
          "suffix": " ms"
        },
        {
          "key": "duration_sec",
          "type": "int",
          "label": "Duration (PiShock)",
          "default": 1,
          "min": 1,
          "max": 15,
          "suffix": " s"
        }
      ],
      "expanded": true
    },
    {
      "key": "g_actions",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Actions",
      "items": [
        {
          "key": "btn_vibrate",
          "type": "action",
          "label": "Vibrate",
          "button": "Vibrate",
          "style": "accent"
        },
        {
          "key": "btn_shock",
          "type": "action",
          "label": "Shock",
          "button": "Shock",
          "style": "danger"
        },
        {
          "key": "btn_sound",
          "type": "action",
          "label": "Sound / Beep",
          "button": "Sound"
        },
        {
          "key": "btn_stop",
          "type": "action",
          "label": "Stop (OpenShock)",
          "button": "Stop"
        }
      ],
      "expanded": true
    },
    {
      "key": "g_chatbox",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Chatbox line (idle)",
      "items": [
        {
          "key": "show_when_offline",
          "type": "bool",
          "label": "Show line even when offline",
          "default": false
        },
        {
          "key": "prefix",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Prefix",
          "default": "⚡"
        },
        {
          "key": "last_ttl",
          "type": "int",
          "label": "Last action stays for",
          "default": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 300,
          "suffix": " s",
          "hint": "0 = forever. How long the last shock stays on the normal status line (when not using / after the replace-event)."
        },
        {
          "key": "max_name_len",
          "type": "int",
          "label": "Max name length",
          "default": 20,
          "min": 3,
          "max": 64,
          "suffix": " chars",
          "hint": "Live-log usernames longer than this are truncated before they enter the chatbox."
        }
      ],
      "expanded": false
    }
  ]
}
